# ASDD project steering

**Source of truth:** `.harness/steering/` — parent and every ASDD subagent must **`Read`** these files directly (no `.kiro/steering`).

Index: `.harness/steering/README.md` · Skills: `.harness/steering/skills.md` · Portability: https://github.com/eencinasq/asdd-harness-kit#adopter-checklist · Modules: https://github.com/eencinasq/asdd-harness-kit/tree/main/cli/modules

## When to load steering

**INIT:** Read `.harness/PROGRESS.md` → generated `.harness/state/registry.json` → `.harness/state/slices/<slice-id>/manifest.json` → `paths.features` (if set) → `.harness/steering/` <!-- steering-gen:always -->
(always files: `controls`, `manifest`, `README`, `security-rules`, `session-loop`, `skills`; auto files by tag per `.agents/agents/_runtime-template.md`)
<!-- steering-gen:end -->. Pick one feature **only** when `phase` is `implementation`. If every slice is `DONE`/`PARKED`/`ABANDONED` and the human named no slice: stop — ask for new intent or explicit unpark.

